Package: poolidentify
Title: Partial Identification of Prevalence from Clustered Pool Counts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("MX-PVS", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "AngusMcLure@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Computes prevalence bounds from binomial mixture moments and
    clustered pool counts, quantifies sampling uncertainty across independent
    locations, and evaluates bias and coverage under working mixing models.
